WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:08.550
Find any document in the office, see what has expired, and replace it with a new version.

2
00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:16.120
Documents is the library of every file in the office: tenant papers, leases, permits, contracts and staff files.

3
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:23.440
The top shows what is on file, what expires within thirty days and what has already expired.

4
00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:32.660
Search by title or reference, or filter by what the document belongs to: a brand, a lease, an employee or a unit.

5
00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:36.760
Let us deal with the expired ones.

6
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.840
Open a document.

7
00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:44.090
You can read it right here, without downloading it.

8
00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:50.780
Its details show what it belongs to, when it was issued and when it expires.

9
00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:55.150
When the renewed copy arrives, use Upload a new version.

10
00:00:55.150 --> 00:01:06.290
Set the new issue and expiry dates and drop in the file. The old one stays in Versions, and the reminders start again from the new date.

11
00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:13.720
The office reminds the owner of each document thirty days before it expires, so nothing lapses by surprise.
